flowchart TD
  Editorial[Immutable editorial-v1 source] --> Manifest[animation-v1 manifest]
  Manifest --> L1[Level 1 approved baseline]
  Manifest --> Candidates[Level 2 candidate layers]
  Candidates --> QA[Structural and source-preservation QA]
  QA --> Audition[Layered Remotion audition]
  Audition --> Promotion[Explicit human promotion]
  Promotion --> Manifest

  L1 --> Proof[Rendered Level 1 / Level 2 proof]
  Manifest --> Proof
  Proof --> Evidence[Deterministic motion evidence]
  Proof --> AB[Normal-speed A/B review video]
  Evidence --> HumanGate[Human visual-quality review]
  AB --> HumanGate
  HumanGate --> Receipt[Durable acceptance receipt]
  Receipt --> Milestone[Level 2 milestone gate]

  Manifest --> Canonical[Canonical Scene V2 render]
  Narration[Chatterbox narration cues] --> Finalize[Audio finalization]
  Canonical --> Finalize
  Finalize --> Reel[Level 2 reel candidate]
